{
 "id": "01a0f820-5637-7521-b371-bab8fbffa088",
 "evidence": "As of 2026-10-01: no tests use a `postgres` marker and there's no docker-compose file in the repo, so `docker compose up db` can't work. `make test-fast` (pytest -m \"not postgres\") therefore runs ALL tests, including tests/test_payments.py, which is marked `integration` and POSTs to an external sandbox (https://sandbox.payments.example). To run only offline unit tests, use `pytest -m \"not integration\"`. Markers aren't registered anywhere (no conftest/pytest.ini/[tool.pytest]).",
 "source_file": "tests/test_payments.py"
}
